        "text": "MKT Time Trial Bot\nAPP\n — \n3/22/22, 9:04 AM\nTuesday, March 22, 2022 at 9:04 AM\nAn incorrect number of arguments were provided: 1\nUsage:\n!submit <track> <time> <media link (optional)>\n• track: The track abbreviation, such as wpr, or cclr\n• time: Either the total time (1:45.47) or split times (52.35/53.12)\n• media link: An optional media link to attach with your submission\n• image: Don't forget to send a screenshot of your time!\n\nExamples:\n• To submit for Waluigi Pinball R without lap times:\n!submit wpr 1:45.47\n• To submit for Cheep Cheep Lagoon R with lap times:\n!submit cclr 38.59/38.44\n• To submit for Singapore Speedway with a media link:\n!submit ss 1:11.50 https://youtu.be/XXXXXXXXXXX",
